 \u2728 Creator Merch & Marketplace  \nCreators can now design and inspire in-game items such as boots, hats, and other gear.  \nThey can **gift items directly to players** or **list them on the Marketplace** \u2014 it\u2019s up to the creator whether items are public or kept as rare, gifted-only pieces.\nThe Marketplace updates with new creators and gear added daily **without requiring game updates**. This creates an endless flow of fresh drops.\n", "created_date": 1770493636, "id": "33751997374414742", "version": "0.1", "version_code": 494, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8464137310294097", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "33853960467551765"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4132387000218482"}]}, "change_log": "# \u2728 Creator Merch & Marketplace  \nCreators can now design and inspire in-game items such as boots, hats, and other gear.  \nThey can **gift items directly to players** or **list them on the Marketplace** \u2014 it\u2019s up to the creator whether items are public or kept as rare, gifted-only pieces.\nThe Marketplace updates with new creators and gear added daily **without requiring game updates**. This creates an endless flow of fresh drops.\n", "created_date": 1770492806, "id": "33751841541096992", "version": "0.1", "version_code": 493, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_ap